{"sha": "e3dbe35b44ac4c9b4e0cac215f0d1f6179d945c17ba2fc4b5ee139dff334e698", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:cells-and-electrolysis} 章 --- 电化学电池与电解}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:1}", "锌电极为阳极，\\ce{Zn -> Zn^{2+} + 2e-}；铜", "电极为阴极，\\ce{Cu^{2+} + 2e- -> Cu}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:2}", "% ledger: const:F", "$Q = 0.20 \\times 1800 = \\qty{360}{C}$；$n(e^-) = 360/96485 =", "\\qty{3.7e-3}{mol}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:3}", "它使电路闭合，并使每个溶液保持电中性，其中的", "离子移入各隔室。若没有它，电路即为断开，无", "电流通过，电压表读数为零，灯泡不亮。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:4}", "$2.5 \\times 3600 = \\qty{9000}{C}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:5}", "不能：反应向与自发方向相反的方向进行。", "发电机提供能量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:6}", "阳极（铜，$-$）：\\ce{Cu -> Cu^{2+} + 2e-}。阴极（银，$+$）：", "\\ce{Ag+ + e- -> Ag}。总反应：\\ce{Cu + 2Ag+ -> Cu^{2+} + 2Ag}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:7}", "三年为 $3 \\times 365 \\times 24 = \\qty{26280}{h}$；", "$0.010 \\times 26280 = \\qty{263}{mA.h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:8}", "% ledger: const:F, aw:Ag", "$Q = 0.50 \\times 2400 = \\qty{1200}{C}$；$n(e^-) = n(\\ce{Ag}) =", "1200/96485 = \\qty{0.0124}{mol}$；$m = 0.0124 \\times 107.9 =", "\\qty{1.34}{g}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:9}", "电流在导线中由铜（$+$）流向锌（$-$），", "与电子方向相反。\\ce{K+} 离子向铜", "隔室移动，该隔室失去 \\ce{Cu^{2+}}；\\ce{NO3-} 离子向锌", "隔室移动，该隔室得到 \\ce{Zn^{2+}}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:10}", "两者中发生氧化的都是阳极。在原电池中，阳极", "为 $-$，反应自发进行，化学能转化为", "电能；在电解池中，阳极与发电机的 $+$ 极相连，", "反应被迫进行，电能转化为", "化学能。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:11}", "\\qty{12}{mL}：方程式 \\ce{2H2O -> 2H2 + O2} 表明，", "生成两分子氢气对应一分子氧气，", "且等物质的量的气体体积相等。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:12}", "% ledger: aw:Zn, const:F", "$n(\\ce{Zn}) = 5.0/65.4 = \\qty{0.076}{mol}$；", "$n(\\ce{Cu^{2+}}) = 0.100 \\times 0.50 = \\qty{0.050}{mol}$；二者按一比一反应，", "故铜离子先耗尽。$n(e^-) = 2 \\times 0.050", "= \\qty{0.100}{mol}$，$Q = \\qty{9.65e3}{C} = \\qty{2.68}{A.h}$。在", "\\qty{50}{mA} 电流下：$2.68/0.050 = \\qty{54}{h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:13}", "$Q = 2.0 \\times 3600 = \\qty{7200}{C}$；$E = 7200 \\times 1.5 =", "\\qty{1.08e4}{J}$，即 $1.5 \\times 2.0 = \\qty{3.0}{W.h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:14}", "% ledger: const:F", "$Q = \\qty{7200}{C}$，$n(e^-) = \\qty{0.0746}{mol}$。每个", "\\ce{H2} 需两个电子：$n(\\ce{H2}) = \\qty{0.0373}{mol}$，$V = \\qty{0.90}{L}$。每个", "\\ce{O2} 需四个电子：$n(\\ce{O2}) = \\qty{0.0187}{mol}$，$V = \\qty{0.45}{L}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:15}", "阳极溶解的铜与阴极沉积的铜相等，", "两极通过的电子数相同：铜的含量为 $2.84/3.00 = \\qty{94.7}{\\percent}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:cells-and-electrolysis:1}", "% ledger: const:F, const:NA, aw:Li, dch:CH4", "\\textbf{1.} 阳极：锂在此被氧化。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 石墨电极，即阳极。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 电子由石墨电极经手机流向氧化物电极；", "锂离子经电解质沿同一方向迁移，", "即由石墨流向氧化物。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 其反应可由充电器逆向驱动。", "", "\\textbf{5.} \\qty{4.000}{A.h}，即 $4.000 \\times 3600 =", "\\qty{14400}{C}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $14400/96485 = \\qty{0.1492}{mol}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $0.1492 \\times \\num{6.022e23} = \\num{8.99e22}$ 个电子。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $4.000/0.25 = \\qty{16}{h}$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $0.20 \\times 14400 = \\qty{2880}{C}$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $E = 14400 \\times 3.7 = \\qty{5.3e4}{J}$，约 \\qty{53}{kJ}。", "", "\\textbf{11.} $53280/3600 = \\qty{14.8}{W.h}$。", "", "\\textbf{12.} 燃烧 \\qty{1}{g} 甲烷释放的能量（\\qty{55.7}{kJ}）略多于", "一块充满电的手机电池所储存的能量。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $1000/14.8 = 67.6$：可充满 67 次。", "", "\\textbf{14.} \\ce{Li+ + e- -> Li}：还原反应。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 充电器迫使反应", "沿与自发方向相反的方向进行。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $14400/2.0 = \\qty{7200}{s}$，即 \\qty{2.0}{h}。", "", "\\textbf{17.} 每个电子对应一个锂离子：\\qty{0.1492}{mol}。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $0.1492 \\times 6.9 = \\qty{1.03}{g}$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 一次完整充电过程中，约 \\qty{1.03}{g} 锂在", "两极之间往返移动。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}